Relevant columns and their potential usage  
• "ad_format_type": filter for image–type ads (`WHERE "ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'`)  
• "topic": filter for Health topic (`WHERE "topic" ILIKE '%Health%'`)  
• "advertiser_verification_status": keep only verified advertisers (`= 'VERIFIED'`)  
• "advertiser_location": keep only advertisers located in Cyprus (`= 'CY'`)  
• "audience_selection_approach_info": JSON field to verify that  
  – "demographic_info" <> 'NOT_USED'  
  – "geo_location"  <> 'NOT_USED'  
  – "contextual_signals" <> 'NOT_USED'  
  – "customer_lists"  <> 'NOT_USED'  
  – "topics"  <> 'NOT_USED'  
• "region_stats": JSON‑array column used to  
  – pick the record whose `"region_code" = 'HR'` (Croatia)  
  – check `"times_shown_availability_date"` IS NULL  
  – check `"first_shown" > '2023‑01‑01'` and `"last_shown" < '2024‑01‑01'`  
  – obtain `"times_shown_upper_bound"` for ordering  
• "creative_page_url": the value finally requested  
• "creative_id": handy for grouping / selecting maximum upper‑bound  

General WHERE conditions that will be combined  
1. "ad_format_type" = 'IMAGE'  
2. "topic" ILIKE '%Health%'  
3. "advertiser_verification_status" = 'VERIFIED'  
4. "advertiser_location" = 'CY'  
5. JSON inside "audience_selection_approach_info" shows every required method not equal to 'NOT_USED'  
6. JSON inside "region_stats" has a row whose "region_code" = 'HR', "times_shown_availability_date" IS NULL, "first_shown" > '2023‑01‑01', "last_shown" < '2024‑01‑01'  
7. Overall time window 2023‑01‑01 … 2024‑01‑01 (inclusive bounds already enforced in #6)  

