  – check `"times_shown_availability_date"` IS NULL  
  – check `"first_shown" > '2023‑01‑01'` and `"last_shown" < '2024‑01‑01'`  
  – obtain `"times_shown_upper_bound"` for ordering  
• "creative_page_url": the value finally requested  
• "creative_id": handy for grouping / selecting maximum upper‑bound  

